codex
The evidence supports neither requested conclusion: North’s survey shows overlapping selections, while South’s case review uses a different, incomplete denominator and does not capture all barriers. The turnaround figures also lack a comparable baseline. I’m using a single-slide evidence-status layout with separate source panels and a concise list of what the program needs to collect.
